  "title": "Prosciutto Rolls Ups with Boursin™",
  "description": null,
  "editorial": {
    "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A quick and simple appetizer recipe to accompany your aperitif drink. Your guests will love these Italian Prosciutto Ham rolls ups with Boursin™ Cheese. Add more or less cheese, depending on your taste. Or, cut the rolls in half if you want smaller portions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:wp-recipe-maker/recipe {\"id\":27486,\"template\":\"chic-template-english\",\"updated\":1713250241178} -->\n<!--WPRM Recipe 27486-->\n<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe\">\n\t<h2 class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-name\">Prosciutto Rolls Ups with Boursin™</h2>\n\t<img class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-image\" src=\"https://mycafegourmand.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/IMG_1531.Blog_-1-150x150.png\"/>\t<p class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-summary\">\n\t\t\t</p>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-equipment\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-ingredients\">\n\t\t<ul><li>12 slices Prosciutto ham</li><li>150 g Boursin™ (or any fresh cheese with herbs)</li></ul>\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-instructions\">\n\t\t<ol><li><p>Spread the Boursin™ on about half of each slice of ham.</p><br /><img src=\"https://mycafegourmand.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/IMG_1521.Blog_-1-150x150.png\"/><br /></li><li><p>Roll up the slice.</p><br /><img src=\"https://mycafegourmand.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/IMG_1528.Blog_-1-150x150.png\"/><br /></li><li><p>Put on a nice dish and serve.</p><br /><img src=\"https://mycafegourmand.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/IMG_1537.Blog_-1-150x150.jpg\"/><br /></li></ol>\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-notes\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-meta\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\n<!--End WPRM Recipe-->\n<!-- /wp:wp-recipe-maker/recipe -->",
    "excerpt": null
  },
